Package: netlimiter
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: nftables, iproute2, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, systemd, util-linux, polkitd | policykit-1
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Maintainer: Mohamed <ziramziram1994@gmail.com>
Description: Network limiter and monitor (NetLimiter clone for Linux)
 Per-application bandwidth monitoring, blocking and strict speed limiting
 (tc HTB + IFB, nftables), with a GTK4/libadwaita interface and desktop
 notifications.
